    <Requirement id="ER-P007-01-02" level="1" requirementType="installation">
      <sysml:Name>管路布置清晰紧凑</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统初次投用前应进行管路冲洗，冲洗时应旁通发动机和敏感设备，循环时间不少于2小时，流速不低于1.5 m/s，冲洗后检查过滤器，如有明显污染应重复冲洗，直至清洁。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P007" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-FLUSH-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>管路内残留杂质将导致冷却器堵塞、主机过热。</RiskIfUnmet>
        <ApplicabilityConstraint>本条需求基于MAN BW/Wartsila冲洗程序，适用于类似系统，其他厂家按各自手册确认。</ApplicabilityConstraint>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>冲洗记录显示循环时间≥2h，流速≥1.5 m/s。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>冲洗后过滤器检查无可见污染物。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【管路布置清晰紧凑】，来自原始需求「管路布置应清楚、紧凑并便于施工」。E-SUPP-FLUSH-001（MAN BW/Wartsila冲洗程序）给出了冲洗参数和步骤，支撑了施工安装的完整性。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
